        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Invisible Door Latch</b>\r\n<p>The Ives CL12 invisible latch is ideal for installations where no visible door latch is desired.  Unit can be installed at the top, bottom or side of the door.  It can be mortised into the stop or surface mounted to the stop.  Recommended for use on larger panels or regular sized doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOperation is simple, latching is accomplished by a slight push.  To unlatch the door, a harder push releases the door and pushes the door outwards with 27 lbs of pressure.  Brass and plastic construction, satin chrome finish. Packaged with installation hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: For tall or heavy door <a href=\"/products/auxiliary-pusher-for-cabinet-latch-ives-cl14\"><b>Ives CL14 Auxiliary door Pusher</b></a>, (adds an additional 10 lbs of door opening pressure).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Ives CL12 Invisible Door Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Latch Body Width:  1-14\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Body Height:  2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Body Thickness:  9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width:  5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Height:  1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Projection:  9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Chrome</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
